 data','Combining IR, MS and NMR evidence to argue for one structure over another.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(319,1,18,'DP','Deducing a mechanism from kinetic evidence','Using rate data to rule mechanisms in or out.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(320,1,18,'DP','Explaining anomalies in periodic trends','Accounting for where the trend breaks rather than restating the trend.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(321,2,18,'DP','Using IUPAC nomenclature and conventions','Naming and formula conventions applied consistently.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(322,2,18,'DP','Drawing curly-arrow mechanisms','Arrows that start at electrons and end where they go.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(323,2,18,'DP','Reporting to a precision the uncertainty supports','Significant figures that match the measurement, not the calculator.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(324,2,18,'DP','Structuring a full internal assessment report','Research question through to evaluation, in the expected shape.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(325,2,18,'DP','Choosing a graph that fits the relationship','Including when a linearised plot is the honest choice.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(326,2,18,'DP','Explaining at the particle level with diagrams','Making the invisible step visible to the reader.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(327,2,18,'DP','Citing sources in a scientific convention','Consistent referencing of data sources and literature values.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(328,3,18,'DP','Comparing a measured value against a literature value','Finding a reliable accepted value and accounting for the difference.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(329,3,18,'DP','Judging whether a data source is appropriate','Databases and handbooks over secondary summaries.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(330,1,18,'MYP','Making a prediction and giving a scientific reason','Not just what will happen, but why you think so.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(331,1,18,'MYP','Identifying the variables in an experiment','What you change, what you measure, what you keep the same.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(332,1,18,'MYP','Spotting a pattern in your results','Describing what the numbers do as one thing changes.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(333,1,18,'MYP','Suggesting an improvement to a method','A specific change that would make the results more trustworthy.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(334,1,18,'MYP','Explaining a result using particle ideas','Using atoms, molecules and ions to explain what you observed.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(335,1,18,'MYP','Comparing substances using their properties','Grouping or separating materials by evidence rather than appearance.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(336,1,18,'MYP','Deciding whether a result looks reasonable','Noticing when a number cannot be right, and saying why.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(337,2,18,'MYP','Writing a method someone else could follow','Clear enough that another student could repeat it exactly.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(338,2,18,'MYP','Drawing and labelling apparatus','Standard scientific diagrams rather than pictures of glassware.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(339,2,18,'MYP','Recording results in a table with units','Headings, units and consistent decimal places.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(340,2,18,'MYP','Choosing a suitable graph for the data','Bar chart or line graph, and knowing which one this data needs.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(341,2,18,'MYP','Using correct chemical symbols and formulae','Capital letters, subscripts and balanced equations written properly.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(342,2,18,'MYP','Explaining your findings to the class','Saying what you found and what it means, out loud, to other people.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(343,2,18,'MYP','Using scientific words correctly','Precise terms instead of everyday ones where it matters.',1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(344,1,NULL,'MYP','Asking a question worth investigating',NULL,1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(345,1,NULL,'MYP','Giving a reason for an answer',NULL,1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(346,1,NULL,'MYP','Trying a different approach when stuck',NULL,1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(347,1,NULL,'MYP','Using an idea from one subject in another',NULL,1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(348,1,NULL,'MYP','Telling fact apart from opinion',NULL,1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(349,2,NULL,'MYP','Explaining an idea so a classmate understands it',NULL,1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(350,2,NULL,'MYP','Taking clear notes you can use later',NULL,1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(351,2,NULL,'MYP','Speaking clearly in front of the class',NULL,1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(352,2,NULL,'MYP','Listening properly before responding',NULL,1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29'),(353,2,NULL,'MYP','Writing so the reader can follow your thinking',NULL,1,NULL,'2026-09-23 20:05:29');
